  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo a Preparacin Censo Nacional</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Census Preparation Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE GENERAL OBJECTIVE OF THE PROJECT IS TO PROVIDE STATISTICAL INFORMATION ON SOCIAL AND DEMOGRAPHIC ASPECTS OF THE COUNTRY&apos;S POPULATION, WHICH WILL SERVE AS A BASIS FOR MEASURING THE ACHIEVEMENTS ATTAINED IN THE LAST 14 YEARS THROUGH THE COUNTRY&apos;S ECONOMIC AND SOCIAL POLICIES AND ITS STRUCTURAL REFORMS, AS WELL AS FOR SUPPORTING NECESSARY ADJUSTMENTS TO CURRENT POLICIES.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
